      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 0.5697975158691406
      Target Frame: scan_sliding_map
      Value: Orbit (rviz_default_plugins)
      Yaw: 1.5038070678710938
    Saved: ~
Window Geometry:
